[Mission.Objectives]
Destroy all enemy units in the vicinity of Houffalize.
[Mission.Description]
Operation Wacht am Rhine has begun. Our advance units have bitten deep into the underbelly of the enemy but have encountered stiff resistance near the town of Bastogne.

Your orders are: 
- 	Seize the town ahead
- 	Destroy the enemy entrenched on the hills 
[Mission.Success]
The town has been seized!
[Mission.Failed]
You have lost! All of your attacks were repelled.
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Establish bridgehead on the hills near the town. Destroy all the enemy troops and artillery. 
[Submission_1.Description]
The bridgehead on the hills near the town is a key location in the U.S. defense. Infantry, artillery and anti-tank guns defend this bridgehead.

Your orders: 
- 	Destroy all enemy forces encountered and capture the bridgehead.
[Submission_1.Success]
The bridgehead is ours!
[Submission_1.Failed]
The victory has been lost. U.S. forces have defeated you!
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Repel enemy counterattacks and capture the town.
[Submission_2.Description]
After the initial loss of the bridgehead, the Americans have committed their reserves and are counter-attacking. 

Your orders:
- 	Hold the bridgehead, counterattack the enemy and capture the town. 
[Submission_2.Success]
You have held out!
[Submission_2.Failed]
You have lost this battle!

[StringTable.reserv]
Reinforcements have arrived.